<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="mt-8 p-6 bg-[#fbfaf8] dark:bg-[#2a2418] rounded-xl border border-[#f3efe8] dark:border-gray-800">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-3xl mb-3">support_agent</span>
<h4 class="font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white mb-2">Need Help?</h4>
<p class="text-xs text-text-sub mb-4 leading-relaxed">Our support team is available Mon-Fri, 9am - 6pm IST.</p>
<a class="text-sm font-bold text-primary hover:underline flex items-center gap-1" href="#">
                            Contact Us <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm">arrow_forward</span>
</a>
</div>
</div>
</aside>
<!-- Content Area -->
<main class="flex-1">
<!-- Quick Glance Cards -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-12">
<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">local_shipping</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white">Free Shipping</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-text-sub mt-1">On domestic orders over ₹10,000</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">assignment_return</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white">30-Day Returns</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-text-sub mt-1">Hassle-free returns &amp; exchanges</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700 flex flex-col items-start gap-3 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
<div class="p-2 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">public</span>
</div>
<div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-text-main dark:text-white">Global Delivery</h3>
<p class="text-xs text-text-sub mt-1">Shipping to 50+ countries</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Shipping Policy -->
<section class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24" id="shipping-policy">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="w-8 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full block"></span>
                        Domestic Shipping Policy
                    </h2>
<div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4">
<p class="leading-relaxed">
                            At Ethnic Elegance, we understand the excitement of receiving your order. We partner with India's most trusted logistics providers to ensure your garments reach you safely and on time. All orders are processed within 24-48 hours of being placed.
                        </p>
<ul class="list-none space-y-3 mt-4">
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
<span><strong>Standard Delivery:</strong> 5-7 business days across major metro cities.</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
<span><strong>Express Delivery:</strong> 2-3 business days (Available for select pin codes at an additional charge of ₹250).</span>
</li>
<li class="flex items-start gap-3">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl mt-0.5">check_circle</span>
<span><strong>Remote Locations:</strong> Please allow 7-10 business days for delivery to remote areas.</span>
</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
<div class="w-full h-px bg-[#e6dfd1] dark:bg-gray-800 my-10"></div>
<!-- International Shipping -->
<section class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24" id="international">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="w-8 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full block"></span>
                        International Orders
                    </h2>
<div class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4">
<p class="leading-relaxed">
                            We ship worldwide! International shipping charges are calculated at checkout based on the weight of the package and the destination country.
                        </p>
<div class="bg-primary/5 dark:bg-primary/10 p-6 rounded-lg border border-primary/20 mt-6">
<h4 class="font-bold text-primary mb-2 text-lg">Duties &amp; Taxes</h4>
<p class="text-sm">
                                Please note that import duties, taxes, and brokerage fees are not included in the product price or shipping and handling cost. These charges are the buyer's responsibility as we are only charging the transportation fee for your order. You may check with your country’s customs office to determine if there will be additional costs.
                            </p>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="w-full h-px bg-[#e6dfd1] dark:bg-gray-800 my-10"></div>
<!-- Returns -->
<section class="mb-16 scroll-mt-24" id="returns">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="w-8 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full block"></span>
                        Returns &amp; Exchanges
                    </h2>
<div class="flex flex-col gap-8">
<p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
                            We want you to love your purchase. If you are not completely satisfied, we offer a hassle-free return and exchange policy. Items must be returned unworn, unwashed, and with all original tags attached.
                        </p>
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
<div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
<div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-green-600 dark:text-green-400">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">check</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Eligible for Return</h3>
</div>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 ml-2">
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Items within 30 days of purchase</li>
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Unworn items with tags attached</li>
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Manufacturing defects</li>
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Incorrect size delivered</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
<div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/30 flex items-center justify-center text-red-600 dark:text-red-400">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">close</span>
</div>
<h3 class="font-bold text-lg">Non-Returnable</h3>
</div>
<ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 ml-2">
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Custom-made or altered items</li>
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Accessories &amp; Jewelry</li>
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Sale or Clearance items</li>
<li class="list-disc ml-4">Used or damaged by customer</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-[#fbfaf8] dark:bg-[#2a2418] p-6 rounded-xl border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-800">
<h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-4">How to initiate a return?</h3>
<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 items-start">
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
<span class="flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-bold text-sm">1</span>
<span class="font-medium">Log into your account</span>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 pl-11">Go to 'My Orders' and select the item you wish to return.</p>
</div>
<div class="hidden md:block w-px h-12 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700"></div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
<span class="flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-bold text-sm">2</span>
<span class="font-medium">Schedule Pickup</span>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 pl-11">Choose a convenient time for our courier partner to collect the package.</p>
</div>
<div class="hidden md:block w-px h-12 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700"></div>
<div class="flex-1">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
<span class="flex items-center justify-center size-8 rounded-full bg-primary text-white font-bold text-sm">3</span>
<span class="font-medium">Receive Refund</span>
</div>
<p class="text-sm text-gray-500 pl-11">Refund initiated within 48 hours of quality check approval.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700">
<button class="bg-text-main hover:bg-black text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm font-bold transition-colors w-full sm:w-auto">
                                    Start a Return Request
                                </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<div class="w-full h-px bg-[#e6dfd1] dark:bg-gray-800 my-10"></div>
<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="scroll-mt-24" id="faq">
<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="w-8 h-1 bg-primary rounded-full block"></span>
                        Frequently Asked Questions
                    </h2>
<div class="space-y-4">
<details class="group bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] rounded-lg border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden">
<summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-1.5 p-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
<span>Do you offer Cash on Delivery (COD)?</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
</summary>
<div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-transparent group-open:border-[#f3efe8] dark:group-open:border-gray-700">
                                Yes, we offer Cash on Delivery for domestic orders up to ₹20,000. For orders above this amount, we require prepaid payment methods for security reasons.
                            </div>
</details>
<details class="group bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] rounded-lg border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden">
<summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-1.5 p-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
<span>Can I cancel my order after placing it?</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
</summary>
<div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-transparent group-open:border-[#f3efe8] dark:group-open:border-gray-700">
                                You can cancel your order within 24 hours of placing it directly from your 'My Orders' page. Once the order has been processed or shipped, it cannot be canceled, but you can initiate a return after delivery.
                            </div>
</details>
<details class="group bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] rounded-lg border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden">
<summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-1.5 p-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
<span>What happens if I receive a damaged product?</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
</summary>
<div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-transparent group-open:border-[#f3efe8] dark:group-open:border-gray-700">
                                We are truly sorry about that! Please email us at support@ethnicelegance.com with photos of the damaged item within 48 hours of delivery. We will arrange for a free pickup and a replacement or full refund immediately.
                            </div>
</details>
<details class="group bg-white dark:bg-[#211c11] rounded-lg border border-[#e6dfd1] dark:border-gray-700 overflow-hidden">
<summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-1.5 p-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-colors">
<span>How long does the refund process take?</span>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined transition group-open:rotate-180">expand_more</span>
</summary>
<div class="px-4 pb-4 pt-2 text-sm text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 leading-relaxed border-t border-transparent group-open:border-[#f3efe8] dark:group-open:border-gray-700">
                                Once your returned item is received and passes our quality check, the refund is initiated within 48 hours. The amount will reflect in your original payment source within 5-7 business days.
                            </div>
</details>
</div>
</section>
</main>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Footer -->
<%- include('partials/footer') %>